===Etymology 2===
{{etymon|en|id=box|:inh|enm:case}}
From {{inh|en|enm|case}}, from {{der|en|fro-nor|casse}} (compare {{cog|fro|chasse||box, chest, case}}), from {{der|en|la|capsa|t=box, bookcase}}, from {{m|la|capiō|t=to take, seize, hold}}. {{doublet|en|cash|chase|chasse}}. Compare {{cog|es|caja}}, {{cog|ast|caxa}}, {{cog|pt|caixa}}.

